         "text": "Write the difference quotient: \\( \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(3 + h) - f(3)}{h} \\), with \\( f(3 + h) = - 3 h^{2} - 13 h - 12 \\) and \\( f(3) = -12 \\).",
